# Voters encouraged to vote in the November 3, 2026, General Election

November 2, 2026

As Election Day approaches, voters are encouraged to cast their ballots at any of the 152 open vote center locations. To find the nearest vote center, please go to the Registrar of Voters website at[voteinfo.net](https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/links-1.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fvoteinfo.net*2F/1/010001a19e3b4034-8352dee4-0629-461c-b95b-a20bd000f769-000000/KCFF1vltYbKQNd2q2BLqjzHHwcjRMgYxCx_Y6YcBsXA=452__;JSUl!!JTyGX330HN5x6Ko!By3YEcVms4blzVNX77_IvgdbcrpgW5tIkivYP0XgRB_xE2KX7yR8MUIpKGPJw7ydRnLLJ8CzcTBtvSozUlRBLXI$ "(opens in a new window)") or call the Registrar of Voters Office at (951) 486-7200. The hours of operation for the vote centers are 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. and from 7 a.m. to 8 p.m. on Election Day.

“We support all registered voters to make their voices count by casting their ballots in the upcoming election,” said Art Tinoco, Registrar of Voters for Riverside County.

To ensure everyone has the opportunity to vote, Riverside County offers various options for casting ballots, including vote-by-mail, official ballot drop boxes, and in-person voting at vote centers.

“We are committed to providing accessible and secure voting options for all voters,” Tinoco added. “Whether you choose to vote-by-mail, vote early, or vote in person on Election Day, your participation in the electoral process is crucial. 'Your Voice, Every Vote, Our Future.'”

Registered voters are encouraged to familiarize themselves with the candidates and ballot measures before heading to the polls. Detailed information can be found in both the State Voter Information Guide and the County Voter Information Guide, which have been distributed to all registered voters via mail and are also accessible on [voteinfo.net](https://urldefense.com/v3/__https:/links-1.govdelivery.com/CL0/https:*2F*2Fvoteinfo.net*2F/2/010001a19e3b4034-8352dee4-0629-461c-b95b-a20bd000f769-000000/JdSolhBflVFMDRgLcDtL6FK4L_rc4VNEjURE67n5-dk=452__;JSUl!!JTyGX330HN5x6Ko!By3YEcVms4blzVNX77_IvgdbcrpgW5tIkivYP0XgRB_xE2KX7yR8MUIpKGPJw7ydRnLLJ8CzcTBtvSozLhYoDE8$ "(opens in a new window)")

